cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this tool contributed to your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "neware-batch-export"
abstract: >
  A batch-export tool for Neware .ndax files that produces complete 8-sheet
  .xlsx output identical to manual single-file export, solving the data
  truncation problem in Neware BTS 8.0 built-in batch export. Designed for
  building machine-learning-ready battery datasets at scale.
